### Expected behavior

The value follows each settled model call (the latest call wins, up or down), with turn-completion accounting still authoritative when the turn ends.

A goal with a token budget would then reach `budget_limited` during a turn rather than at its end: goal accounting reads the fresh total (`resolveEntryFreshTotalTokens(entry)`, `src/config/sessions/goals-transitions.ts:35`), raises `tokensUsed` from it (`:45`) and sets `budget_limited` once it reaches the budget (`:58-60`). Writers run it with each total they publish (`persistSessionUsageUpdate`, `src/auto-reply/reply/session-usage.ts:180`), and session listings derive the displayed goal state from the row's current total (`src/gateway/session-utils-display.ts:201`).

